            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ngon Thai (SAWASDEE)",
            "review_text": "Leannie\nHong Kong, China3214 contributions\n1\nGood value pad thai\nFeb 2023 • Couples\nThis place like many others in Vietnam wasn't much to look at but had good reviews online so we have it a go.\nWe were both craving pad Thai and so ordered two chicken ones which were actually really tasty, there was a miscommunication with the waitress when I asked for soy sauce as she brought me sticky rice which we had to request was taken off the bill at the end.\nThe pork fried spring rolls were really bland and worth passing on. They had draught beers at a very reasonable price. Service was very friendly, only thing that was odd was being asked if we wanted a dessert as we were still eating our main!!\nIf you can avoid using the bathroom then do so\nRead more\nWritten February 18, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
