            "review_title": "Review at Quan Ngon Thai (SAWASDEE)",
            "review_text": "JSTrip_77\nSarajevo, Bosnia and Herzegovina1194 contributions\n0\nNice Thai in Tay Ho\nDec 2018 • Solo\nAlthough this place lacks some of the polish of the downtown Thai restaurants or even the restaurants further up To Ngoc Van, it's very good Thai food at great prices - and with a really great view especially if you go at lunch time. So, the tom yum Gai was really delicious, the pad Thai was also really good. The service is fast and efficient. This place is very non-descript from the street but there's an actual restaurant in the back overlooking a pond. It's quite nice. In fact, I want twice this week alone!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 22, 2018",
